---
// src/pages/shipping-returns.astro
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Shipping & Returns | Red Surge Fitness"
  description="Information on shipping times, rates, and our 30-day return policy for Red Surge Fitness jump ropes."
>
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tighter mb-4 uppercase">
      Shipping & <span class="text-red-500">Returns</span>
    </h1>

    <div
      class="prose prose-invert prose-lg prose-headings:font-bold prose-headings:tracking-tight prose-a:text-red-400 hover:prose-a:text-red-300 prose-p:text-gray-300 mt-12"
    >
      <h2>Shipping Information</h2>
      <p>
        We know you want to get your new jump rope and start training as soon as
        possible. All orders are processed within 1 to 2 business days
        (excluding weekends and holidays) after receiving your order
        confirmation email.
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Free Standard Shipping:</strong> On all orders over $50.00 within
          the United States.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Standard Shipping Rate:</strong> Flat rate of $4.99 for orders under
          $50.00.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Delivery Estimates:</strong> Standard shipping typically takes 3
          to 5 business days once shipped.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        <em
          >[Note to Owner: Adjust the shipping times and rates above as needed
          based on your actual supplier/fulfillment setup.]</em>
      </p>

      <h2>Returns & Exchanges</h2>
      <p>
        We stand behind the quality of our gear. If you are not completely
        satisfied with your purchase, we offer a <strong
          >30-day return policy</strong
        >. You have 30 days after receiving your item to request a return.
      </p>

      <h3>Eligibility for Returns</h3>
      <p>
        To be eligible for a return, your item must be in the same condition
        that you received it: unused, in its original packaging, and with all
        tags or included tools (like adjustment wrenches) intact. We do not
        accept returns on items that show signs of heavy use or wear and tear.
      </p>

      <h3>How to Start a Return</h3>
      <p>
        To start a return, please contact us at <a
          href="mailto:returns@redsurgefitness.com"
          >returns@redsurgefitness.com</a
        >. If your return is accepted, we’ll send you instructions on how and
        where to send your package. Items sent back to us without first
        requesting a return will not be accepted. The customer is responsible
        for return shipping costs unless the item arrived damaged or defective.
      </p>

      <h3>Refunds</h3>
      <p>
        We will notify you once we’ve received and inspected your return, and
        let you know if the refund was approved or not. If approved, you’ll be
        automatically refunded on your original payment method within 10
        business days. Please remember it can take some time for your bank or
        credit card company to process and post the refund too.
      </p>

      <h2>Damaged or Defective Items</h2>
      <p>
        Please inspect your order upon reception and contact us immediately if
        the item is defective, damaged, or if you receive the wrong item, so
        that we can evaluate the issue and make it right. Please include photos
        of the damaged product in your email to our support team.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
